; MARK: 3: 💬 ゴクチョーが犯人の理由
; ==============================================================================
; ＠ト書き▼議論2-3 ゴクチョーが犯人の理由
; BGM変更：rAwTell Owk...
@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_7_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@SetBadId CommonBadEndId:3

# Judge2-3-1

@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-First
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Effect
@Gosub Path:System/System_Subroutine.BeginDebate-Last
@ChangeTrialPauseMode Enable:false ProcessTimer:true

@HidePerspectiveStageScreen Index:1 Reset:true

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Angry_Closed1,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:遠野ハンナと<br>沢渡ココの証言によれば、<br>死体を発見した当時<br>あの部屋は密室だった<br>という事よ。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Flushed_Open1,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ここにいる私たちには<br>鍵を開けることはおろか、<br>鍵をかけることすら<br>できなかった……。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……なら、<br>誰にも犯行は<br>不可能だったことになる。<br>そうでしょう？|#0102Trial03_Nanoka003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:誰にも犯行が不可能って……<br>ならアイツは<br>どうやって死んだんだよ！|#0102Trial03_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"<link=\"Objection_01_02_03_01\">自殺</link>か！？<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_03_02\">事故</link>か！？<br>それとも<link=\"Objection_01_02_03_03\">病死</link>とか言う気！？<br>そんなんありえねーだろ！|#0102Trial03_Coco002|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Gross_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……さっきと言ってること、<br>違うんじゃねーの～！？|#0102Trial03_Coco003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Closed2,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:いいえ。<br>他殺だった事は<br>否定しないわ。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:65,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Pensive_Closed1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:私の主張は<br>【犯人は私たちの中にいない】<br>というだけよ。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:だって鍵を開けるなんて……<br>この施設の管理者にしか<br>できないはずだもの。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Default,Angle01/Arms>Arms01,Angle01/ArmL-,Angle01/ArmR-
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Alisa Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:……それで<br>ゴクチョーが殺したって<br>言いたいのか？|#0102Trial03_Alisa001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR1,ArmL10,Eyes1_Normal_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:ええ。<br>懲罰房の鍵を<br>自由に開ける事ができた<br>運営が犯人よ。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR2,ArmL9,Eyes1_Normal_Open3,Mouth1_Normal_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"私たちにはできない。<br>なぜなら<br><link=\"Objection_01_02_03_04\">鍵が閉まっていた</link>の<br>だから……。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmL5,Angle01/ArmR-,Eyes1_Normal_Closed1,Mouth1_Surprised_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:拷問中に殺してしまったか……<br>もしくは最初から<br>口封じが目的だったのか。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka009| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Eyes1_Angry_Open1
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:なんにせよ、<br>運営側が私たちに<br>佐伯ミリアを殺した罪を<br>なすりつけようと<br>しているだけ……。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka010| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Nanoka.Normal1,ArmR3,ArmL6,Eyes1_Angry_Open1,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Nanoka Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:それがこの事件の真相よ。|#0102Trial03_Nanoka011| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4


